<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>403 Akses Ditolak - E-Voting OSIS & MPK</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
<div style="min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:var(--bg-main);padding:2rem;">
  <div style="max-width:520px;width:100%;text-align:center;">
    <div style="font-size:5rem;margin-bottom:1rem;">🚫</div>
    <h1 style="font-size:2.5rem;font-weight:900;color:var(--red);margin-bottom:0.5rem;">403</h1>
    <h2 style="font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--text-main);margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Akses Ditolak</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--text-muted);font-size:0.87rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
      Anda tidak memiliki izin untuk mengakses halaman ini.<br>
      Role Anda (<strong><%= userRole %></strong>) tidak termasuk dalam: <strong><%= allowedRoles.join(', ') %></strong>.
    </p>
    <div class="alert alert-error" style="text-align:left;">
      <span class="alert-icon">🔒</span>
      <span>Middleware RBAC mencegah akses tidak sah ke <code><%= path %></code>.</span>
    </div>
    <div class="flex gap-3" style="justify-content:center;margin-top:1.5rem;">
      <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary">← Kembali ke Beranda</a>
      <a href="/logout" class="btn btn-outline">Logout</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
